{"excerpt_id":"ex_a6a330af5a09_063","source_id":"src_a6a330af5a09","source_hash":"86077c49cf7475e767f1a0213d3c6cad4da39f2b7d1de69829f6d0432f232260","text":":ref:`Variant<class_Variant>` **parse_string**\\ (\\ json_string\\: :ref:`String<class_String>`\\ ) |static| :ref:`🔗<class_JSON_method_parse_string>`","location_hint":"paragraph 83","char_start":10581,"char_end":10727,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T04:13:11.979Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_a6a330af5a09_064","source_id":"src_a6a330af5a09","source_hash":"86077c49cf7475e767f1a0213d3c6cad4da39f2b7d1de69829f6d0432f232260","text":"Attempts to parse the ``json_string`` provided and returns the parsed data. Returns ``null`` if parse failed.","location_hint":"paragraph 84","char_start":10729,"char_end":10838,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T04:13:11.979Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_a6a330af5a09_065","source_id":"src_a6a330af5a09","source_hash":"86077c49cf7475e767f1a0213d3c6cad4da39f2b7d1de69829f6d0432f232260","text":".. rst-class:: classref-item-separator","location_hint":"paragraph 85","char_start":10840,"char_end":10878,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T04:13:11.979Z"}
